ystems, fluid conveyance, fuel systems and components, fuel tank inserting systems, hydraulic pumps and motors, hydraulic valves and actuators, pneumatics, seals, sensors, and thermal management products. The company sells its products to original equipment manufacturers, distributors, direct-sales employees. Parker-Hannifin Corporation was founded in 1917 and is headquartered in Cleveland, Ohio.","fullTimeEmployees":59850,"city":"Cleveland","country":"United States","website":"https://www.parker.com","industry":"Specialty Industrial Machinery","sector":"Industrials"},"news":[{"title":"4 Industrial Manufacturing Stocks to Gain on Robust Industry Trends","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/4-industrial-manufacturing-stocks-gain-132000038.html","publisher":"Zacks","date":"2026-11-13"},{"title":"Parker-Hannifin (PH) Lifted Full Year Guidance, Is The Stock Fully Priced?","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/parker-hannifin-ph-lifted-full-021717643.html","publisher":"Simply Wall St.","date":"2026-11-13"},{"title":"Parker Hannifin (PH) Stock Seems About Right After A 206% Run","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/parker-hannifin-ph-stock-seems-232548418.html","publisher":"Simply Wall St.","date":"2026-11-12"},{"title":"Is One Shrinking Number The Biggest Risk To Eaton Stock?","link":"https://www.trefis.com/stock/etn/articles/624624/is-one-shrinking-number-the-biggest-risk-to-eaton-stock/2026-11-12","publisher":"Trefis","date":"2026-11-12"},{"title":"Why Is Arxis Stock Going Up?","link":"https://www.trefis.com/stock/arxs/articles/624732/why-is-arxis-stock-going-up/2026-11-12","publisher":"Trefis","date":"2026-11-12"},{"title":"How Many Stocks Have Matched Parker Hannifin's Winning Streak?","link":"https://www.trefis.com/stock/ph/articles/624397/how-many-stocks-have-matched-parker-hannifins-winning-streak/2026-11-11","publisher":"Trefis","date":"2026-11-11"}],"info_date":"2026-11-14"}